      "messages": {
        "202110000": {
          "id": 202110000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "主爵，我正在準備自己的第一次「極限探險」計劃",
          "next": [
            202110001
          ]
        },
        "202110001": {
          "id": 202110001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "汝等穿越星際，定能向我直諫更全面的建議",
          "next": [
            202110002,
            202110004,
            202110005
          ]
        },
        "202110002": {
          "id": 202110002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "你一個人嗎？打算去哪裡玩？",
          "next": [
            202110003
          ]
        },
        "202110003": {
          "id": 202110003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "若有人想一同前往，凱撒當然不會反對。",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110004": {
          "id": 202110004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "打算去哪裡玩？",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110005": {
          "id": 202110005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "請登上星穹列車",
          "next": [
            202110006
          ]
        },
        "202110006": {
          "id": 202110006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "也許能作為我旅途的一站，不過先留待以後再說",
          "next": [
            202110007
          ]
        },
        "202110007": {
          "id": 202110007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "目的地：未來的翁法羅斯",
          "next": [
            202110008
          ]
        },
        "202110008": {
          "id": 202110008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "往日行於征途，記憶中的萬邦不是紛爭烈火，便是黑潮死水",
          "next": [
            202110009
          ]
        },
        "202110009": {
          "id": 202110009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "當記憶的種子盛放，翁法羅斯會煥發生機，我正好也可以一探",
          "next": [
            202110010
          ]
        },
        "202110010": {
          "id": 202110010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "我想駕駛帆船穿越斯基亞納的海域，那兒的烏雲和巨浪無時無刻不在搏鬥",
          "next": [
            202110011
          ]
        },
        "202110011": {
          "id": 202110011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "聽說過拉冬嗎？那裡有一處極高之地，能夠觸及雲層",
          "next": [
            202110012
          ]
        },
        "202110012": {
          "id": 202110012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "正在思考是翼裝飛行，還是高空跳傘",
          "next": [
            202110013
          ]
        },
        "202110013": {
          "id": 202110013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "主爵有何建議？",
          "next": [
            202110014,
            202110016,
            202110019
          ]
        },
        "202110014": {
          "id": 202110014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "我都可以，畢竟之前也經常旋轉跳躍，然後高空降落進入一個世界",
          "next": [
            202110015
          ]
        },
        "202110015": {
          "id": 202110015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "聽起來甚好",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110016": {
          "id": 202110016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "說來話長…我經常用高空降落的方式進入一個世界",
          "next": [
            202110017
          ]
        },
        "202110017": {
          "id": 202110017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "不如你也試試",
          "next": [
            202110018
          ]
        },
        "202110018": {
          "id": 202110018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "聽起來甚好",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110019": {
          "id": 202110019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "請珍愛生命！",
          "next": [
            202110020
          ]
        },
        "202110020": {
          "id": 202110020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "放心，凱撒沒有那麼嬌弱",
          "next": [
            202110021
          ]
        },
        "202110021": {
          "id": 202110021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "前不久剛接受了小貓兒的野外求生特訓，金織爵的繩索編織培訓",
          "next": [
            202110022
          ]
        },
        "202110022": {
          "id": 202110022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "該開始劍旗爵的游泳特訓課了",
          "next": [
            202110023
          ]
        },
        "202110023": {
          "id": 202110023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1412,
          "text": "之後見，主爵",
